  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pemba Dairy Milk Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Dairy).Location: Pemba, Southern Province, Zambia.Summary: Pemba Dairy Cooperative Society will use the funds for establish a solar satellite milk collection depot in areas not previously serviced within their catchment area. The funds will also be used toward providing artificial insemination services to farmers to improve animal breed for better milk yield, as well as provision of veterinary and spray race dipping services.</narrative>
  </description>
